    "LocalizationKey": "Apparel_ClothMask_dyed_charcoal_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A simple cloth face covering tied behind the head. Keeps the wind and the worst of the dust off your face. A guard who spots you while you are Wanted grows suspicious half as fast. Rubbed through with charcoal pigment, it has darkened to a soft ash-grey. The dye is purely for looks: it offers nothing the undyed cloth mask doesn't."
